@step Resume human access without reactivating grants.
@static cadrumo-runtime config profile resume
@blocked interactive-tty Requires the reader's suspended profile and fresh password entry through the hidden terminal prompt.
@step Resume human access and explicitly reactivate one selected grant.
@static cadrumo-runtime config profile resume --grant GRANT_UUID
@blocked interactive-tty Requires fresh hidden password entry and an actual grant ID deliberately selected for reactivation.
